{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien creatures \u2013 the Beboks \u2013 have arrived on Earth to extinguish the most wonderful time of the year. To make matters worse, <strong>Santa and his helpers have been kidnapped</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hope still remains. Take on the role of a brave Snowman \u2013 the last defender of Christmas, who embarks on a perilous journey. Save Santa, defeat the invaders, and restore faith in goodness and peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight for the <strong>soul of Christmas</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign with a clear goal: </strong>find Santa and defeat the alien invaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat </strong>\u2013 arcade-style melee and ranged combat, requiring quick reflexes,<strong> dodging attacks, and exploiting enemy weaknesses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse locations </strong>\u2013 frosty villages, snow-covered forests, icy caves, and alien cosmic spaces, each with its own challenges and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming sequences and challenges \u2013 </strong>jumps, traps, and environmental interactions that will test your precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, focused adventure </strong>\u2013 perfect for an intense evening or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions </strong>\u2013 all current and future content is included with your purchase.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete_Chapter_1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413360/68f00fd027bd39026db46bbced22ac883bc53997.jpg"},